filldraw(circle((3,-.4),1),gray);
filldraw(circle((4.8,-.4),1),gray);
filldraw(circle((3.2,.5),1),gray);

draw((6,.7)--(8,.7),Arrow);

filldraw(circle((11,.2),2),gray);
[/asy]

The double-bar graph shows the number of home runs hit by McGwire and Sosa during each month of the 1998 baseball season. At the end of which month were McGwire and Sosa tied in total number of home runs?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(28,0)--(28,21)--(0,21)--(0,0)--cycle,linewidth(1));

for(int i = 1; i < 21; ++i)
{

draw((0,i)--(28,i));
}

for(int i = 0; i < 8; ++i)
{

draw((-1,3i)--(0,3i));
}

label("0",(-1,0),W);
label("3",(-1,3),W);
label("6",(-1,6),W);
label("9",(-1,9),W);
label("12",(-1,12),W);
